Package: speaker
Type: Package
Title: Object-Oriented Interface to Praat Phonetic Analysis
Version: 0.9.5
Date: 2025-11-22
Authors@R: c(
    person("Fredrik", "Nylén", , "fredrik.nylen@umu.se", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0003-3373-0934"))
    )
Maintainer: Fredrik Nylén <fredrik.nylen@umu.se>
Description: Provides direct, efficient access to Praat C implemented
    functionality from R using Rcpp and R6 object-oriented design. Similar
    in concept to the Parselmouth package for Python, this package allows R
    users to leverage Praat's powerful phonetic analysis capabilities directly
    from R. Includes 17+ Praat object types with 300+ methods for sound
    manipulation, pitch analysis, formant extraction, intensity measurements,
    spectral analysis, TextGrid annotation, and voice quality assessment.
    Features SIMD optimization for 2-4x performance improvements on modern CPUs.
